### GateFlow Distributed Rate Limiter - HTTP Test Suite
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Public Endpoint (No Route Rate Limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public
Accept: application/json

### 3. Standard Rate Limited Endpoint (Token Bucket - Default Settings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/limited
Accept: application/json

### 4. Strict Rate Limited Endpoint (5 requests max, 1 token/sec refill)
# Run rapidly 6 times to observe 429 and fallback response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/strict
Accept: application/json

### 5. Sensitive Login Endpoint (Sliding Window Log - 3 requests per 60s)
# Run 4 times to observe sliding window blocking brute force
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "supersecretpassword"
}

### 6. Get Rate Limiter Stats & Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rate-limiter/stats
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Live Configuration Properties
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rate-limiter/config
Accept: application/json

### 8. Reset Rate Limit State for a Key
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/rate-limiter/reset/gateflow:rl:token_bucket:127.0.0.1:GET:/api/strict
Accept: application/json

### 9. Prometheus Actuator Metrics Export
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
Accept: text/plain

### 10. Rate Limiter Specific Prometheus Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/gateflow.ratelimit.requests.allowed
Accept: application/json

